# ============================================================
# plan: Cryocooler -- run the K508N until it is ended
# ============================================================
# Starts the K508N cryocooler through its block (board supply 24 V on psu1 CH1,
# cooler 12 V, resistor 270 ohm) and keeps it running until the run is ended.
# Thermocouples are recorded every 10 s, so the cooldown shows in Plots.
#
# Start: the cryocooler board connected to psu1 CH1 and its Pico plugged in.
# End:   ended by hand; the end script then cuts psu1 CH1 at once.
# Fails: the board's supply or link does not come up (the reason is in the run
#   log and on the board's status card), a cryo command is refused, or the
#   converter does not report its output on, with no fault, 30 s after turning on.

load rCryoBoard rPSU rSMTC08
record every 10 s

log start
k508n at 12 V with 270 ohm
when CRYO_OK = false then log cooler output off or faulted
hold until end
